      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_14",
      "hash64": "6ED542A31972FC75",
      "text": "阿栗！\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她說要和你對戰。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
