          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_brother_07",
      "hash64": "02D00202D2FE7669",
      "text": "打了場好對戰！\\n但是我知道……\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳拿出真本事會更強！[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
