      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0100_sister_18",
      "hash64": "6ED546A319730341",
      "text": "那個兩人一組參加的東西，\\n叫什麼……定向越野？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
